{
    "title": "Icelandair",
    "description": "With a simple and effective interface, the app provides access to various beneficial features related to your flight, keeping all travel information in one handy location.\r\n\r\nGET MORE OUT OF YOUR SAGA CLUB MEMBERSHIP\r\nSee your Saga Club and Tier Credit status, earn and use Saga Points, add Saga Club card to Wallet, or use your virtual Saga Club card in the app. You can also register Saga Points for past flights.\r\n\r\nBOOK FLIGHTS\r\nSearch for your next travel destination, book your flight with auto-filled information, and access booking details in one place.\r\n\r\nOVERVIEW OF YOUR ENTIRE JOURNEY\r\nManage your journey by preordering meals, choosing a seat, or adding baggage to your flight. Check-in online via the app and receive the boarding pass directly. Save your boarding pass in Wallet or share it with other travelers in your booking.\r\n\r\nGET NOTIFIED ABOUT YOUR FLIGHT\r\nReceive notifications at the right time and stay informed at every stage of your journey.",
